{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787548175150237001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"grassy-cracked-morpho","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":4,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"1c243fc2aa318b963f40b00439864804b3bc20f277073adab01c3246db7177d0","event_uuid":"96b90c15-c494-4519-bf2a-92f5bf02a06f","position":{"commit_sha":"bd7f90c67a14760646dd1988563e5b9d8c5d73d7","position":"1787525881223169001-96b90c15-c494-4519-bf2a-92f5bf02a06f"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"0a50bdf5f8eb1c147ddd4019c827649449c469698603988470fa46f65155f135","event_uuid":"a12484ba-3af1-43ce-b9e1-380c6ab9e63d","position":{"commit_sha":"25d88950f7ce692ab6f1c2984a81f6ba12cbe662","position":"1787525900460049001-a12484ba-3af1-43ce-b9e1-380c6ab9e63d"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"8692d53998d85d883d6f542dc3609a713e19fb45e37c94599e9935c3803726c6","event_uuid":"8e014de3-8a95-4fc9-8ce9-d82074110b87","position":{"commit_sha":"2ebc2a011ee9ab7452c764fc859e56d4f1fbdf0f","position":"1787525921214305001-8e014de3-8a95-4fc9-8ce9-d82074110b87"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"87230219cb9ab3b1ffe5fc005edec895b3c43f4f3ccadf4a1c815bc353e63990","event_uuid":"4b52bb55-2f6a-43b0-a4e0-1e99004b9cbe","position":{"commit_sha":"21623139b4966b56383cb7c8f313a4f41d4a6b10","position":"1787525939619173001-4b52bb55-2f6a-43b0-a4e0-1e99004b9cbe"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787525881223169001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"8e014de3-8a95-4fc9-8ce9-d82074110b87","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"4000-2df3-398d-44e2"},{"link_uuid":"4b52bb55-2f6a-43b0-a4e0-1e99004b9cbe","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"f380-19d4-4b2f-4bf8"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe completed fix on reportable-chalkstony-eeve skips full-history commit discovery only when accepted-scope file impact is empty. Impact-present closes still run the same unbounded path, and current end-to-end telemetry shows it now dominates the user-visible close command.\n\nFrozen Codex-rollout sample (2026-08-22 through 2026-08-23T21:15Z), limited to canonical tracker closes with a matched Bedrock COMPLETION_VERDICT and metrics.llm_calls > 0: n=10 completed closes, p50=28.24m, p90=57.32m, p99=61.60m. The matched completion-verifier workflows themselves are generally 1-4m; recent 25-62m closes spend most of their time before the verifier sidecar.\n\nStatic mechanism: close_precheck._check_work_landed calls commit_impact.referencing_commits for every impact-present close. That helper reads all 2,690 commits and extract_ticket_refs produces 2,229 unique historical candidates. 702 candidates require alias/prefix resolution; _scan_alias walks the current 5,351-ticket store for each, implying roughly 3.8 million ticket-directory visits before completion verification. Ordinary subject prefixes and deprecated four-digit references enter the candidate set. This is the residual impact-present case left explicitly unchanged by reportable-chalkstony-eeve.\n\n## Plan\n- Add a deterministic performance reproduction for an impact-present close with many historical reference candidates and a large tracker.\n- Replace per-candidate full-store alias resolution with a batch/indexed resolution strategy while preserving every accepted commit-ticket reference form and ambiguity behavior.\n- Keep descendant credit, attached commits, --ref behavior, file-impact-vs-diff enforcement, and fail-closed git-error semantics unchanged.\n- Measure the repaired pre-verifier scan and pin a scaling assertion that prevents history x tracker behavior from returning.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Impact-present close commit discovery does not perform a full tracker walk per unique historical candidate.\n- [ ] The scan cost is bounded to one tracker index/build per invocation plus linear code-history parsing.\n- [ ] Full, two-quad short, alias, Jira, compatibility four-digit/prefix, trailer, and leading-subject reference forms retain current matching and ambiguity semantics.\n- [ ] Descendant ticket credit and file-impact-vs-diff enforcement remain covered end to end.\n- [ ] A scale-focused regression test fails on the current history-times-tracker implementation and passes on the repair.\n- [ ] Before/after wall-time and scan-count evidence is recorded on this ticket.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_engine_support/commit_impact.py","reason":"Batch or index historical commit-reference resolution for impact-present close checks."},{"path":"src/rebar/_ids.py","reason":"Provide or reuse an indexed multi-reference resolver without per-candidate whole-store scans if this remains the ownership seam."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_attach_commits.py","reason":"Pin impact-present close semantics and scan-count scaling."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","f380-19d4-4b2f-4bf8"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["performance","completion-gate","discovered"],"ticket_id":"a8ac-48b5-0759-40e5","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Impact-present ticket close scales with code history times tracker size","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["96b90c15-c494-4519-bf2a-92f5bf02a06f","a12484ba-3af1-43ce-b9e1-380c6ab9e63d","8e014de3-8a95-4fc9-8ce9-d82074110b87","4b52bb55-2f6a-43b0-a4e0-1e99004b9cbe"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787548175150237001,"uuid":"bb11fc69-5374-4cfe-8619-6aec19c00d32"}